      "message": "[error] Line 1253: 🔴 The grace period is only checked when another `onConnectionFailed()` callback reaches `rotateTrackedMembers`; there is no timer or periodic re-evaluation after `trackedSince` expires. In the empty-device case this change targets, the failed node is returned to the swarm\u0027s known set but no retry is scheduled, and an offline member may produce no presence callback, so a member that fails once during the first 30 seconds can remain tracked indefinitely and consume a slot. Schedule a one-shot/periodic expiry check (with lifetime/untracking cancellation or revalidation), or invoke this check from an existing maintenance path, and cover the no-presence/no-second-failure case with a test.",
